    title: "go: a call inside a PACKAGE-LEVEL function literal emits no call edge (cobra Run handlers) -- 578 of 1,331 fmt.Fprintf sites on beads (43.4%) invisible to every catalogue row"  # 65fd
    status: violated  # 65fd
